# Thumbnails / macOS AppleDouble sidecars
._*
# The four "!._relpath*" negations that used to live here are gone (2026-08-03):
# the path-config files were renamed from ._relpath-to-latexroot.ltx to
# relpath-to-latexroot.ltx, so they no longer collide with the ._* rule above.
# On macOS a leading "._" marks an AppleDouble metadata sidecar, which is why
# bsdtar silently swallowed all five of them during Public generation and shipped
# a tree that could not compile. Do not reintroduce a "._" prefix for real content.


