# CSV policy (2026-09-02, owner: "stop gitignoring csv files"). CSVs are TRACKED
# by default so data INPUTS are never silently swallowed — a blanket `*.csv`
# rule had hidden Code/Empirical/Data/{LorenzAll,LorenzEd}.csv, which
# CreateLPfig.py needs, so a fresh checkout could not draw the Lorenz figure.
# Only GENERATED csv OUTPUTS are ignored, and only by location:
Code/HA-Models/FromPandemicCode/Figures/**/*.csv
Code/HA-Models/FromPandemicCode/Tables/**/*.csv
Code/HA-Models/solution_cache/**/*.csv
# (Code/HA-Models/Results/registry/ and the .venv* dirs already have their own
# directory rules, so their generated CSVs stay ignored regardless.)

