# --- Run provenance (Code/HA-Models/provenance.py) -------------------------
# Policy: provenance is ignored by DEFAULT (candidate/scratch runs), and the
# sidecars for FROZEN/PROMOTED deliverables are explicitly force-added
# (`git add -f`) by reproduce.sh's auto-commit. So routine runs never spam git,
# but committed results still travel with their provenance.
#
# Travelling sibling sidecars next to any result (RUN_<run_id>.prov.json):
RUN_*.prov.json
# Ad-hoc central manifests + pip-freeze for non-reproduce entry points
# (Stage-A calibration, do_all, direct python). reproduce.sh's own tracked
# comp_*.json manifests are NOT matched by the provrun_ prefix.
/reproduce/run-manifests/provrun_*.json
/reproduce/run-manifests/provrun_*_pip_freeze.txt

# --- Two-machine Stage-A/Stage-B orchestration -----------------------------
