Code/HA-Models/_parked_solution_cache_*/

# --- Parked solution-cache trees + local lockfile backups (2026-09-03) ------
# The rule above (_parked_solution_cache_*/) predates the naming the parking
# steps actually use, so two 1.7 GB trees sat unignored and a plain
# `git add -A` would have committed them irreversibly. No leading slash: these
# match at the repo root and under Code/HA-Models/ alike.
solution_cache_data_parked_*/
# Pre-upgrade copies of the lockfile kept by hand; `uv.lock` itself is already
# ignored above, but the dated siblings are not matched by that entry.
uv.lock.local-*

